; autocad-stili-testo.dxf (AutoCAD 2021, Matleyx78/dxf-test-file, CC0, docs/tappe/0.8/dxf-di-prova.md):
; STYLE table Standard (txt), Annotative (XDATA AcadAnnotative), ALTEZZA5 (40=5),
; LARGHEZZA08 (41=0.8, 50=15), CAPOVOLTO (71=6), each but the first two with XDATA ACAD;
; $TEXTSTYLE = Standard; four TEXT, one per style but Annotative ([0.8-RT11], work #683).
; Version, units and counts read from the file and confirmed by ezdxf; the table read into
; the model and rewritten from it gives back the same groups (ADR 0018, point 6).
D = DXF source=autocad-stili-testo
? version D -> AC1032
? units D -> 4
? count D -> TEXT 4
? unhandled D -> none
? roundtrip D -> identical
? roundtrip D as=cadx -> identical
